      "name": "Simsar",
      "username": "Simsar",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/simsar/{size}/2870_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-08-25T23:24:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just like Spider-man fights the Shocker on a near constant basis (and never seems to lose), Plague Rat is just one of those villains that has the b-movie creature feature quality to him that makes him work. Personally, fighting Plague Rat is kind of a warm up game for me, he's really not that hard with the right heroes in play and if you can wreck his ongoing cards (Nightmist is a good one to use consistently), he's really not much of a threat, just a general annoyance.</p><p>Also, to suggest a signature. \"You met the boomstick, but have you felt the matchstick?\" - ExPatirette before setting fire to the Pike Industries Building</p>",
